  "body": "Buy the location. Create the dream - all day sun and close sweeping sea views, this four-bedroom coastal haven is just a short stroll to Mairangi Bay village and beach, offering easy, flexible living perfect for teens, extended family and guests. This is a substantial value-add opportunity for builders to reclad, renovate and reap the rewards.  \r\n\r\nElevated and north facing, the home showcases the glistening Gulf views from much of the interior, with the main living area and wraparound decks capturing them to perfection. From breakfast coffees to relaxed evening drinks, the coastal outlook provides a fascinating backdrop. \r\n\r\nThe upper level features the master bedroom with ensuite, kitchen, dining and main living area, with the living flowing seamlessly to sun-drenched decks. Downstairs are three double bedrooms, family bathroom, separate toilet and a second lounge which flows to a deck and rear grounds, ideal for teenagers, extended family, guests or working from home. \r\n\r\nOutside, the private landscaped grounds provide a peaceful retreat, while the internal-access double garage offers excellent storage, and outside guest parking. \r\n\r\nThe location is the gem: Mairangi Bay Village cafes, restaurants, supermarket, the beach and surf club, coastal walkways, and many sporting facilities are just a short walk away, along with excellent public transport and a short drive to the motorway. \r\n\r\nSpoilt for choice with top North Shore school zones including Mairangi Bay and Campbells Bay Primary, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Rangitoto College, both Westlake schools, as well as nearby transport to Kristin School.  \r\n\r\nAfter 26 years, the owners are moving on. While the home's classic 1990s plaster construction offers immediate comfort, you can sit back and enjoy the glistening views and a premium coastal lifestyle while exploring the opportunity to add major value through recladding and renovation.  \r\n\r\nPremium location. Top Schools. Significant potential - view today",
